CORE
main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ converted to the derived class: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ pointer to member of the base: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
